  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-07-01T01:20:00.360Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if you guys added inputs we could bind in the steamVR settings for individual gestures. With the index controllers I find using actual hand gestures to trigger animations a lot more awkward than the vive's old setup. Others have suggested putting an option to make the index trackpad behave like the vive's for gestures. That isn't a bad idea, but I want the ability to fire gestures from any button I want. If you guys added steamVR inputs for each gesture, we could bind them to the trackpad in dpad mode or as options in a radial menu to accomplish the same task. We could also bind gestures to other keys, like unused A buttons or clicking in the trackpad.",
